    `o 9 r 25(8) serve the notice on all other parties to the action`

-- src:997 | (8) The notice for setting down an action for trial must be served on all other parties to the action within 24 hours after the date on which the notice is filed.
@ref O 9 r 25(8) (src:997)
GIVETH A DEONTIC `o 9 r 25(8) party` `o 9 r 25(8) act`
`o 9 r 25(8) the party setting down the action must serve the notice` MEANS
    PARTY `o 9 r 25(8) the party setting down the action for trial`
    MUST `o 9 r 25(8) serve the notice on all other parties to the action`
    WITHIN 1
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY `o 9 r 25(8) the party setting down the action for trial` BECAUSE "the notice for setting down an action for trial was not served on all other parties within 24 hours after the date on which it was filed"

